{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":117756,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm still catching up on a bunch of threads. Everything looks great! And it's good to post your list so that you can keep track. There are always soooo many things to do, it seems! Yikes. Now onto the chicken cutlets... They actually work for larger busts? I'm considering a keyhole dress and ca...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904893\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442518486,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117733,"Title":"liked a post you made in Valentinemrs2Be - Let The F...","Message":"Hello!\n\nValentineMrs2Be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYour inspiration pix are gorgeous. Glad to hear that your wedding planner is on the ball! [emoji4]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79578-valentinemrs2be-let-the-fun-begin-february-2016-puerto-rico\/?view=findpost&p=1904896\n","Sender":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442517418,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117526,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904914\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" Thanks!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm hoping that they work for larger busts. I'm about the same size as you and I need something for a bit of extra support, so i'm hoping these will help. Going to try them for sure.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442468015,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117508,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm still catching up on a bunch of threads. Everything looks great! And it's good to post your list so that you can keep track. There are always soooo many things to do, it seems! Yikes. Now onto the chicken cutlets... They actually work for larger busts? I'm considering a keyhole dress and ca...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904893\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442436974,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117503,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCan't believe you are getting so close. Glad to see it all coming together. Everything looks gorgeous! [emoji4]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1904889\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442433457,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117432,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79536-support-and-accountability-group\/?view=findpost&p=1904877\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"cruisebride2016\" I love your motivation! You are doing so well, way to go girl!\n \n@\"vancouverpetunia\" welcome back! How was your trip? I'm so glad you've joined us. I'm glad you have a friend to join you in your fitness\/health journey. I know you'll be able to meet your goals by April and we're here to motivate you:) And great job turning down the chocolate cookie, that's a step in the right direction <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"deecol\" Great job hun! How are you feeling? How is the HIITmax program? I've been tempted to try it but didn't know if it was good or not.\n \nAs for me, I have not had a great week. I had my bachelorette party last Saturday and after a lot of drinking and eating, unfortunately my body gave up on me. I have been sick with a fever and a bad cold since Sunday. So basically I haven't exercised. I also haven't eaten too much since I can't taste anything at all. I have been so tempted to workout but Der says I'll just get worse. I'm hoping I'll get better soon!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442406725,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117425,"Title":"liked a post you made in Support And Accountability...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi ladies - I'm back from vacation and living up to my commitment to come back and make my first post. I'm Erin from Vancouver and I'm getting married April 7, 2016 at Now Sapphire. I've been wanting to lose weight\/inches prior to the wedding. I even signed up for personal training sessions but...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79536-support-and-accountability-group\/?view=findpost&p=1904832\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442406282,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117423,"Title":"sent you a friend request","Message":"vancouverpetunia,\n\ndeecol wants to be your friend!\n\nThis message has been sent because deecol has added you to their friends\nlist. As you've chosen to approve all friend requests, you will need to visit your\nfriends list and approve them.\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&section=friends&module=profile&do=list&tab=pending\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442406135,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":281751},{"Id":117413,"Title":"liked a post you made in Support And Accountability...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi ladies - I'm back from vacation and living up to my commitment to come back and make my first post. I'm Erin from Vancouver and I'm getting married April 7, 2016 at Now Sapphire. I've been wanting to lose weight\/inches prior to the wedding. I even signed up for personal training sessions but...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79536-support-and-accountability-group\/?view=findpost&p=1904832\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442403745,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117369,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLove your band! I wanted something similar but wasn't sure how it would look with my e-ring. We haven't bought our bands yet, so I will definitely revisit that! Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1904834\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442389494,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117361,"Title":"liked a post you made in Support And Accountability...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi ladies - I'm back from vacation and living up to my commitment to come back and make my first post. I'm Erin from Vancouver and I'm getting married April 7, 2016 at Now Sapphire. I've been wanting to lose weight\/inches prior to the wedding. I even signed up for personal training sessions but...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79536-support-and-accountability-group\/?view=findpost&p=1904832\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442384201,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117340,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLove your band! I wanted something similar but wasn't sure how it would look with my e-ring. We haven't bought our bands yet, so I will definitely revisit that! Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1904834\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442354520,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116343,"Title":"liked a post you made in Diadiamond's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI agree that the setting does most of the work! [emoji4] It will be gorgeous. You are getting so close!!!Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/?view=findpost&p=1904223\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442144762,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116295,"Title":"liked a post you made in Diadiamond's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndiadiamond just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI agree that the setting does most of the work! [emoji4] It will be gorgeous. You are getting so close!!!Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/?view=findpost&p=1904223\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442125417,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116099,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYour ring is gorgeous. His ring is gorgeous. The engagement photos are gorgeous. Hahaha can you tell I'm a fan? What is the park?Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904489\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441972847,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115929,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYour ring is gorgeous. His ring is gorgeous. The engagement photos are gorgeous. Hahaha can you tell I'm a fan? What is the park?Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904489\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441920063,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115818,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904490\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks @\"vancouverpetunia\" We went to Whytecliff Park in West Vancouver. Have you been there? It's gorgeous!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441902402,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115814,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYour ring is gorgeous. His ring is gorgeous. The engagement photos are gorgeous. Hahaha can you tell I'm a fan? What is the park?Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904489\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441902355,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115794,"Title":"liked a post you made in Alternative To Linen?","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe got cotton (blend?) no wrinkle pants from Banana Republic. Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79569-alternative-to-linen\/?view=findpost&p=1904232\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441893819,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115130,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nToday is our 7 month countdown! Enjoying some relaxation and wine tasting in the Okanagan Valley this week. Hope everyone is well and seeing their planning come together [emoji4]\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904286\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441698307,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115119,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nToday is our 7 month countdown! Enjoying some relaxation and wine tasting in the Okanagan Valley this week. Hope everyone is well and seeing their planning come together [emoji4]\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904286\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441694517,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114964,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI love the stacked bands, too! My e-ring is probably actually an eternity band, so I'm hoping to slowly add a few more bands over time. Hadn't thought about the mismatched gold - love that idea. I was talking to a woman at work who has a beautiful e-ring with a band on either side. She told her h...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1904233\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441568810,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114953,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou two look adorable! And the pups too [emoji4] Congrats!Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904224\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441567983,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114863,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904234\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" Aww thank you! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> \n \n@\"TinkerSofi\" Thanks!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> I am searching high and low.. going to the outlets this weekend because I HAVE to find something I love.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441531648,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114857,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou two look adorable! And the pups too [emoji4] Congrats!Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1904224\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441531575,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114594,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dw Wedding After Postponing...","Message":"Hello!\n\nValentineMrs2Be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWelcome @  (and also @ !). I've never been to PR - but it's on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79563-dw-wedding-after-postponing-but-i-am-ok-introducing-me\/?view=findpost&p=1904083\n","Sender":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441308372,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114543,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dw Wedding After Postponing...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWelcome @  (and also @ !). I've never been to PR - but it's on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79563-dw-wedding-after-postponing-but-i-am-ok-introducing-me\/?view=findpost&p=1904083\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441285336,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114538,"Title":"liked a post you made in July 11, 2016 - Date Booked...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy TA went to Dreams La Romana earlier this year and raved about it! Congrats!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79556-july-11-2016-date-booked\/?view=findpost&p=1904092\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441284967,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114507,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nRe purchasing kids' sizes. Works great for women and I think you can even brag about it. But does anyone remember the episode of Sex & the City where Samantha is dating a short guy and then sees his suit jacket is from Nordstrom's Boys or something? That didn't work out so well. LOL\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904089\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441284401,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114479,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLOVE your shoes. And also jealous of your shoe closet [emoji12]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n=========================================