s before he popped the question we thought about getting married in the Caribbean! All of our friends and family can&#039;t wait! We expect between 70-100 to come!\n\nWe met on August 24th! So we would like to get married on the same date! \n\nWe have looked at many resorts! But everything is so expensive! I&#039;m trying to find a resort which will only cost our guests between 1500-1800 Canadian 5 star, all inclusive! Is this possible? We do not prefer Cuba for our wedding due to poor variety of food and connection service ie. wifi\n\nWhere is the best place to go in August and a good bang for your buck? \n\nSo far my fave is Grand Riviera Princess in Mayan Riveria, but the cost is $1900 per person. Help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1904979,"PostDate":1442581799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jeff and I met in Cuba 7 years ago. We are both from GTA Canada. 2 years before he popped the question we thought about getting married in the Caribbean! All of our friends and family can't wait! We expect between 70-100 to come!<br>\nWe met on August 24th! So we would like to get married on the same date! <br>\nWe have looked at many resorts! But everything is so expensive! I'm trying to find a resort which will only cost our guests between 1500-1800 Canadian 5 star, all inclusive! Is this possible? We do not prefer Cuba for our wedding due to poor variety of food and connection service ie. wifi<br>\nWhere is the best place to go in August and a good bang for your buck? <br>\nSo far my fave is Grand Riviera Princess in Mayan Riveria, but the cost is $1900 per person. Help!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natandjeffsayido@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.27.71.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442547781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Natandjeff","Id":284851,"Name":"Natandjeff","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79598","Title":"Destination - August 2016? Help!","LastPostDate":1442581799},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
