: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"> - Reserved for future use<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78683\/official-now-jade-wedding-thread\/10#post_1744737' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\">Post<\/span><\/a><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78683\/official-now-jade-wedding-thread\/10#post_1744737' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\"> #19<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"> - Re served for future use<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Again, if you have anything to add to this, please feel free to send me a PM or shoot me an email (<a href='mailto:Faberphotography@charter.net' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Faberphotography@charter.net<\/a>) and I will gladly update the thread.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">The old <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\">NOW<\/span><\/a><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\"> Jade Thread<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"> is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(24,24,24);font-size: 10pt\">* edited to add attachment of NOW Jade Resort Pictures<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(24,24,24);font-size: 10pt\">** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. \u00a0The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. <u><strong>\u00a0This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.<\/strong><\/u> \u00a0When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172013300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392134614,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b00044eae223f10f375558ec8c9658c1","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Overall Coordinator is Pilar Gonzalez \/ Groups &amp;amp; Convention Manager&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Pilar - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com&#039;&gt;weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;01152-998-872-8888 ext 4006&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Resort Website&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amresorts.com\/wedding_guides\/nojrc-wedding-guide.pdf&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;Wedding Guide&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/NowJade&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Facebook Page&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.travelbybob.com\/517\/resort\/\/Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun-Resort-&amp;amp;-Spa.html?t=1#map-tab&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Resort Map&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade\/photos-videos#light_box_video_2&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Virtual Tour&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;555 rooms, 7 different restaurants&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Symbolic or Non-Denominational Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;This ceremony focuses on love, marriage, family and society. Mexican law does not consider this ceremony legally valid. No documentation or blood tests are required.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Civil or Legal Ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;This ceremony is performed by a judge and focuses on family and respect for the couple. A list of requirements must be met in order to be legally married under Mexican law.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Legal Requirements:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Bride, Groom &amp;amp; Witnesses must arrive in Canc\u00ban 4 working days prior to the wedding day (Saturdays, Sundays &amp;amp; Holidays do not count). Symbolic and non-legal ceremonies allow flexibility for arrival date. Please speak with the wedding coordinator to discuss requirements.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;The wedding coordinator must receive the following documents in order to start the corresponding application for a Wedding in the Civil Registry Office.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tourist Card (you will get one upon arrival to the Canc\u00ban airport). Make sure your name is written as it appears on your passport.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;If either the bride or groom is divorced, original Birth Certificates are required with the originating country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per birth certificate. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;If bride is divorced, a copy of the Final Divorce Decree is required with your country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per page. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Valid Passports.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Blood tests, performed in M\u00a9xico. Test are not valid if performed elsewhere and should not be performed more than 14 days prior to the ceremony. The blood will be tested for HIV, RPR (sexually transmitted diseases) and blood type. The results will be ready in 24 hours and will be provided with a certificate of the blood test. The charge is $250 USD + 11% tax per couple, to be paid directly to the doctor in cash the day the test is performed.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Witness Information. The names, addresses, nationalities, ages, occupation, relationship, copies of tourist cards and valid identification of the four witnesses. The Wedding Coordinator will provide the legal form to fill out.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Consider the fee for the Judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s transportation. The Judge usually performs the civil ceremony at their office, but will oblige to come to the resort if the transportation is provided. The round trip fare from the city is $70 USD. This should be paid directly to the Judge on the wedding day or can be arranged in advance through the wedding coordinator.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;The Marriage Certificate is only valid in Mexico. In order to make it legal internationally, the Wedding Coordinator will send a copy of your License to the Validation Process. The fee will be $165 USD +11% tax. The process will take up to 2-3 months. Once the document is apostilled, the resort will send all documentation to couples home address.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595152,"PostDate":1331777369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Overall Coordinator is Pilar Gonzalez \/ Groups & Convention Manager<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Pilar - <a href='mailto:weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">01152-998-872-8888 ext 4006<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Resort Website<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.amresorts.com\/wedding_guides\/nojrc-wedding-guide.pdf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\">Wedding Guide<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26292\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26292\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>NOW WEDDING PLANNING  FORM.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>141.5KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">7 downloads<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/NowJade' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Facebook Page<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.travelbybob.com\/517\/resort\/\/Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun-Resort-&-Spa.html?t=1#map-tab' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Resort Map<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><br><a href='http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade\/photos-videos#light_box_video_2' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Virtual Tour<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">555 rooms, 7 different restaurants<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Symbolic or Non-Denominational Wedding<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">This ceremony focuses on love, marriage, family and society. Mexican law does not consider this ceremony legally valid. No documentation or blood tests are required.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Civil or Legal Ceremony<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">This ceremony is performed by a judge and focuses on family and respect for the couple. A list of requirements must be met in order to be legally married under Mexican law.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Legal Requirements:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Bride, Groom & Witnesses must arrive in Canc\u00ban 4 working days prior to the wedding day (Saturdays, Sundays & Holidays do not count). Symbolic and non-legal ceremonies allow flexibility for arrival date. Please speak with the wedding coordinator to discuss requirements.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">The wedding coordinator must receive the following documents in order to start the corresponding application for a Wedding in the Civil Registry Office.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Tourist Card (you will get one upon arrival to the Canc\u00ban airport). Make sure your name is written as it appears on your passport.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">If either the bride or groom is divorced, original Birth Certificates are required with the originating country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per birth certificate. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">If bride is divorced, a copy of the Final Divorce Decree is required with your country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per page. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Valid Passports.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Blood tests, performed in M\u00a9xico. Test are not valid if performed elsewhere and should not be performed more than 14 days prior to the ceremony. The blood will be tested for HIV, RPR (sexually transmitted diseases) and blood type. The results will be ready in 24 hours and will be provided with a certificate of the blood test. The charge is $250 USD + 11% tax per couple, to be paid directly to the doctor in cash the day the test is performed.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Witness Information. The names, addresses, nationalities, ages, occupation, relationship, copies of tourist cards and valid identification of the four witnesses. The Wedding Coordinator will provide the legal form to fill out.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Consider the fee for the Judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s transportation. The Judge usually performs the civil ceremony at their office, but will oblige to come to the resort if the transportation is provided. The round trip fare from the city is $70 USD. This should be paid directly to the Judge on the wedding day or can be arranged in advance through the wedding coordinator.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">The Marriage Certificate is only valid in Mexico. In order to make it legal internationally, the Wedding Coordinator will send a copy of your License to the Validation Process. The fee will be $165 USD +11% tax. The process will take up to 2-3 months. Once the document is apostilled, the resort will send all documentation to couples home address.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172013300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392135004,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d95dba50a40d3daeeeb69d26f68e934","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Your Moments Wedding Package &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $999 USD OR COMPLIMENTARY &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;(This package is complimentary when booking a minimum of 7 nights in the Preferred Club Ocean View or higher, or if 5 rooms are reserved for a minimum of 3 nights at any room category.)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Symbolic Ceremony*\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 10 guests)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 10 guests)\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Now to Eternity Wedding Package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;2013 SELLING PRICE $2,399 USD \/\/ 2014 SELLING PRICE $2,499 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 25 guests)\n\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 25 guests)\n\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)\n\n\u2022 Make-up and hair styling for the bride\n\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)\n\n\u2022 Private dinner reception (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Photo Package (24 full color photographs)\n\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas\n\n\u2022 1 corsage and 1 boutonniere for the bridesmaid and best man\n\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request and availability)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)\n\n\u2022 Free anniversary nights (see pg. 9 for details)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Diving Wedding Package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $2,999 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake for up to 25 guests\n\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast for up to 25 guests\n\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)\n\n\u2022 Makeup and hair styling for the bride on wedding day\n\n\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas\n\n\u2022 2 corsages and 2 boutonnieres for the wedding party\n\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table\n\n\u2022 Gazebo d\u00e9cor \u2014 25 chairs with white covers, ceremonial table and aisle runner\n\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Private Dinner Reception for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)\n\n\u2022 Video of the ceremony (30-minute edited DVD)\n\n\u2022 Choice of guitarist or saxophonist at the ceremony (1 set, 45 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Photo package (24 color photographs taken during the ceremony) and wedding album\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service night of the ceremony with rose petal-drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine\n\nand chocolate-covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Romantic dinner on the beach (one evening during stay)\n\n\u2022 Late checkout for the couple (upon request and availability)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)\n\n\u2022 Free Anniversary Nights (see pg. 9 for details)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;If you have over 25 guests the following charges will apply:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Eternity Dinner: $48 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Diving Dinner: $53 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Cake: $7 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Champagne: $4 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Cocktail hour: $15 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Up can upgrade to the Devine dinner menu for $5 per guest.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;The wedding packages include white chair covers, white table linens, and white decorations at the ceremony site.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595153,"PostDate":1331777374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Wedding Packages<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Your Moments Wedding Package <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $999 USD OR COMPLIMENTARY <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">(This package is complimentary when booking a minimum of 7 nights in the Preferred Club Ocean View or higher, or if 5 rooms are reserved for a minimum of 3 nights at any room category.)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Symbolic Ceremony*<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 10 guests)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 10 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Now to Eternity Wedding Package<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">2013 SELLING PRICE $2,399 USD \/\/ 2014 SELLING PRICE $2,499 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 25 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 25 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)<br>\n\u2022 Make-up and hair styling for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)<br>\n\u2022 Private dinner reception (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Photo Package (24 full color photographs)<br>\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas<br>\n\u2022 1 corsage and 1 boutonniere for the bridesmaid and best man<br>\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request and availability)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)<br>\n\u2022 Free anniversary nights (see pg. 9 for details)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Diving Wedding Package<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $2,999 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake for up to 25 guests<br>\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast for up to 25 guests<br>\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)<br>\n\u2022 Makeup and hair styling for the bride on wedding day<br>\n\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas<br>\n\u2022 2 corsages and 2 boutonnieres for the wedding party<br>\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table<br>\n\u2022 Gazebo d\u00e9cor \u2014 25 chairs with white covers, ceremonial table and aisle runner<br>\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Private Dinner Reception for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)<br>\n\u2022 Video of the ceremony (30-minute edited DVD)<br>\n\u2022 Choice of guitarist or saxophonist at the ceremony (1 set, 45 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Photo package (24 color photographs taken during the ceremony) and wedding album<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service night of the ceremony with rose petal-drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine<br>\nand chocolate-covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Romantic dinner on the beach (one evening during stay)<br>\n\u2022 Late checkout for the couple (upon request and availability)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)<br>\n\u2022 Free Anniversary Nights (see pg. 9 for details)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">If you have over 25 guests the following charges will apply:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Eternity Dinner: $48 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Diving Dinner: $53 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Cake: $7 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Champagne: $4 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Cocktail hour: $15 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Up can upgrade to the Devine dinner menu for $5 per guest.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\">The wedding packages include white chair covers, white table linens, and white decorations at the ceremony site.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172013300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392135377,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4313b3b9a6f87aec2c40a8a6a8e06e13","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional Wedding Services (whether ala carte or adding to your package)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CEREMONY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Nondenominational Minister $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Services of the Judge (Legal) $600 (includes paperwork, judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fees, and marriage license)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Blood test and medical certification (must be paid in cash directly to the doctor) $250&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Certified translation (per sheet) $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tiffany Chairs $10 per chair&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SET UP&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (2-50 guests) $200 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (50-100 guests) $300 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (101-200 guests) $400 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Deluxe s ceremony setup (per person) $15(chairs with white covers, bow and flower corsage hanging in back)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Dance floor for reception (2-50 guests) $800&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Dance floor for reception (50-100 guests) $1,200&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOOD AND BEVERAGE &lt;\/strong&gt;(prices plus 11% tax and 15% service charge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Champagne toast (sparkling wine) $4 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Wedding cake $5-8 per person (depending on the design selected)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Hors d\u00e2\u20ac\u2122oeuvres $15 per person per hour (8 pieces per person)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Cocktails $15 per person per hour&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Eternity Dinner $48 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Divine Dinner $53 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Private event at restaurant terrace $500 (this fee is for the location and does NOT include food and service charge.&amp;nbsp; Accommodates 30-50 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MUSIC (PRICES PLUS 16% TAX)&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nSound System equipment per event\n\n1-50 guests $150\n\n50-150 guests $300\n\nViolinist 45 minute set $650\n\nGuitarist 45 minute set $650\n\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650\n\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100\n\nPiano 45 minute set $770\n\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800\n\nHarp 45 minute set $900\n\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200\n\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100\n\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500\n\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000\n\nAdditional DJ hr $350\n\nBand 45 minute set $1,400\n\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding\n\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 1 $699\n\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 2 $950\n\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150\n\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599\n\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional Photographer (per hour) $99&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Wedding Book\n\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699\n\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999\n\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Fine art canvas prints\n\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129\n\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169\n\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete Wedding Collection&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #1 $590\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #2 $1,000\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #3 $1,620&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #4 $2,100\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional copy of DVD $80\n\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280\n\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOBOOTH&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Silver $649&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Gold $799&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLOWERS &lt;\/strong&gt;(prices plus 11% tax)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Bouquet Selection $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Corsages $55&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Boutonniere $20&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Boutonniere $45&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Ceremony Centerpiece $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Columns and Arrangements (2) $180&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Canopy $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Flower Wedding Arch $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Single Flower $12&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bag with Petals $15&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basket with Petals $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00\n\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00\n\nPaper Luminaries $5.00\n\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00\n\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)\n\nBamboo Chairs $10.00\n\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00\n\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00\n\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)\n\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25\n\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00\n\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)\n\nLight Packages $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOTEL PASSES &lt;\/strong&gt;(guests arriving from other properties)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person\n\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person\n\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;*&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt; Prices are subject to change without prior notice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595154,"PostDate":1331777377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Wedding Services (whether ala carte or adding to your package)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>CEREMONY<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Nondenominational Minister $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Services of the Judge (Legal) $600 (includes paperwork, judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fees, and marriage license)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Blood test and medical certification (must be paid in cash directly to the doctor) $250<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Certified translation (per sheet) $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tiffany Chairs $10 per chair<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>SET UP<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (2-50 guests) $200 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (50-100 guests) $300 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (101-200 guests) $400 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Deluxe s ceremony setup (per person) $15(chairs with white covers, bow and flower corsage hanging in back)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (2-50 guests) $800<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (50-100 guests) $1,200<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FOOD AND BEVERAGE <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax and 15% service charge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Champagne toast (sparkling wine) $4 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Wedding cake $5-8 per person (depending on the design selected)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Hors d\u00e2\u20ac\u2122oeuvres $15 per person per hour (8 pieces per person)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Cocktails $15 per person per hour<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Eternity Dinner $48 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Divine Dinner $53 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Private event at restaurant terrace $500 (this fee is for the location and does NOT include food and service charge.\u00a0 Accommodates 30-50 guests)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>MUSIC (PRICES PLUS 16% TAX)<\/strong><br>\nSound System equipment per event<br>\n1-50 guests $150<br>\n50-150 guests $300<br>\nViolinist 45 minute set $650<br>\nGuitarist 45 minute set $650<br>\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650<br>\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nPiano 45 minute set $770<br>\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800<br>\nHarp 45 minute set $900<br>\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200<br>\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500<br>\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000<br>\nAdditional DJ hr $350<br>\nBand 45 minute set $1,400<br>\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY<\/strong><br>\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding<br>\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Standard Packages<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 1 $699<br>\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 2 $950<br>\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150<br>\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599<br>\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Photographer (per hour) $99<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Wedding Book<br>\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699<br>\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999<br>\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Fine art canvas prints<br>\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129<br>\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169<br>\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Complete Wedding Collection<\/strong><br>\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #1 $590<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #2 $1,000<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master<br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #3 $1,620<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #4 $2,100<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional copy of DVD $80<br>\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280<br>\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOBOOTH<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Silver $649<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Gold $799<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FLOWERS <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Bouquet Selection $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Corsages $55<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Boutonniere $20<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Boutonniere $45<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Ceremony Centerpiece $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns and Arrangements (2) $180<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Canopy $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Flower Wedding Arch $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Single Flower $12<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bag with Petals $15<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basket with Petals $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)<\/strong><br>\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00<br>\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00<br>\nPaper Luminaries $5.00<br>\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00<br>\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)<br>\nBamboo Chairs $10.00<br>\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00<br>\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00<br>\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)<br>\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25<br>\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00<br>\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)<br>\nLight Packages $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>HOTEL PASSES <\/strong>(guests arriving from other properties)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person<br>\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person<br>\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">*<em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"> Prices are subject to change without prior notice<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172013300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey"