a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaids:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7172-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...172-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7138-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...138-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7176-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...176-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>all in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>I love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&productRef=SEARCH' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/s...oductRef=SEARCH<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still working on accessories for them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the colour! I didn't even know pomegranate existed! lol but I really like it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Formatted