ls for them...\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH\"]http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH[\/url]\n\nStill working on accessories for them  :wub:[\/quote]\nGreat prices and dresses!!!  Where was this site when I searched hi and low LOL!!!\n\nAwesome choices :)\n\nThis is what my bridesmaids are wearing... the color is Begonia and it&#039;s from David&#039;s Bridal.\n\n[img]http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/download_zps1504857d.png[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1878834,"PostDate":1416544720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TiffanyMC, on 17 November 2014 - 09:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What styles\/colors are your bm's wearing?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My MOH will wear:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...43s-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaids:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7172-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...172-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7138-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...138-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7176-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...176-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>all in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>I love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&productRef=SEARCH' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/s...oductRef=SEARCH<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still working on accessories for them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Great prices and dresses!!! \u00a0Where was this site when I searched hi and low LOL!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Awesome choices <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>This is what my bridesmaids are wearing... the color is Begonia and it's from David's Bridal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/download_zps1504857d.png\" alt=\"download_zps1504857d.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a d