43","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79564,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c01097af0e0bd23c53a344ef49ba71cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!&amp;nbsp; A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904169,"PostDate":1441394720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!\u00a0 A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType"