or flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/&#039;&gt;beautiful flower girl dress&lt;\/a&gt; ,but I can&#039;t decide which one I&amp;nbsp;should buy&amp;nbsp;? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13px;\"&gt;this is the pictures of flower girl dress:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0067.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0025.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904630,"PostDate":1442199202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">I am looking for flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very <a href='http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beautiful flower girl dress<\/a> ,but I can't decide which one I\u00a0should buy\u00a0? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">this is the pictures of flower girl dress:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0067.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0025.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adelaidepan2012@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"45.34.81.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441592926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Amandajone","Id":284703,"Name":"Amandajone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 13 September 2015 - 07:01 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1442199707,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9900197f45da3c3d821ea746d7554f97","RawContent":"I was going to say # 1 but I changed my mind .... #2 is my fave. Love them both but on #1 it almost looks like the underlay to the lace up top is a bit scant and could show too much skin. If you get my point.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904631,"PostDate":1442199568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\