,{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f18ea083a3e9fad126a345581ded7978","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Both are very pretty. I think I like #1 a little bit better only because I don&#039;t like the \"one strap\" look of #2&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904642,"PostDate":1442209824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Both are very pretty. I think I like #1 a little bit better only because I don't like the \"one strap\" look of #2<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d5014b884a7d2e3ed70a9118382582","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Amandajone\" post=\"1904630\" timestamp=\"1442195602\"]\n[size=3]I am looking for flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very [url=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/\"]beautiful flower girl dress[\/url] ,but I can&#039;t decide which one I should buy ? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.[\/size]\n[size=3]this is the pictures of flower girl dress:[\/size]\n[size=3][img]http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg[\/img][\/size]\n[img]http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg[\/img][\/quote]@[member=\"Amandajone\"] i love #1 super cute !\n\nHappy Planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1904686,"PostDate":1442261806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Amandajone, on 13 September 2015 - 06:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">I am looking for flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very <a href='http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beautiful flower girl dress<\/a> ,but I can't decide which one I\u00a0should buy\u00a0? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">this is the pictures of flower girl dress:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0067.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0025.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284703\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284703-amandajone\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Amandajone<\/span><\/a> i love #1 super cute !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"139.194.101.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c164ae604f346f74457201619899f88c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wow cool....&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i love the second one..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904765,"PostDate":1442333974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow cool....\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i love the second one..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430668422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdi