ng out one day and i saw this dress that was wonderful.. Be that as it may, there was some stuff i didnt like. I'm not a decent drawer... So i needed to do it on the web. Arrives any site that gives you a chance to make your own particular wedding dress, so i can print it off and convey it to somebody to sew when my time does come? Much obliged.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"matandr009@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.204.24.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442159503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joesphpmarks","Id":284796,"Name":"joesphpmarks","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79585","Title":"Outlining My Own Particular Wedding Dress?","LastPostDate":1442159732},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
